#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:34
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_VitoIntro"
msgid ""
"I trained together with my whole family,\n"
"every one of us!\l"
"I'm not losing to anyone!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:39
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_VitoDefeat"
msgid ""
"Better than my family?!\n"
"Is that possible?!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:43
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_VitoPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I was better than everyone in my\n"
"family. I've never lost before…\p"
"I've lost my confidence…\n"
"Maybe I'll go home…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:49
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_OwenIntro"
msgid ""
"I'd heard that there was a tough\n"
"little kid around. Do they mean you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:53
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_OwenDefeat"
msgid "The little shrimp is tough!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:56
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_OwenPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The rumors I heard, that tough little\n"
"kid is from PETALBURG CITY.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:60
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_CarolineIntro"
msgid "You must be getting a little tired.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:63
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_CarolineDefeat"
msgid "No signs of tiring at all!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:66
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_CarolinePostBattle"
msgid ""
"VICTORY ROAD and the POKéMON LEAGUE\n"
"are long and grueling challenges.\l"
"Beware of fatigue!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:71
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_JulieIntro"
msgid ""
"You shouldn't get complacent just\n"
"because you have a lot of GYM BADGES.\p"
"There's always going to be someone\n"
"who's better than you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:77
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_JulieDefeat"
msgid "You're better than me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:80
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_JuliePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Gaze on your collected BADGES and\n"
"remember the TRAINERS you've faced.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:84
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_FelixIntro"
msgid ""
"I've come this far, but the tension's\n"
"giving me awful stomach pain…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:88
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_FelixDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ooh…\n"
"It hurts…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:92
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_FelixPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I can't help getting all tense knowing\n"
"that I'm nearing the POKéMON LEAGUE.\p"
"It's all I can do to feign calm.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:97
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_DianneIntro"
msgid ""
"The elite among the elite gather in\n"
"this cave.\p"
"How are you finding it?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:102
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_DianneDefeat"
msgid "Not rattled in the least bit!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B2F/scripts.inc:105
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B2F_Text_DiannePostBattle"
msgid ""
"You do have guts! I like that!\n"
"Keep it going!$"
msgstr ""
